  <body>

    <% include ./partials/navbar.ejs %>

      <main>
        <p class="animated fadeIn page-title">Testimonials</p>

        <section class="section animated fadeIn">
          <div class="container">
            <p class="section-sub">Colleagues and mentors I've worked with across industry, sport, and academia.</p>

            <div class="testimonial-grid">

              <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="avatar">
                  <img src="images/Robbo.jpg" class="rounded-circle img-fluid" alt="Carl Robinson">
                </div>
                <p>"Navid is someone who I have the utmost respect for due to his professionalism and attitude to working. The time that we spent working together he was always wanting to learn and progress. He always had the mindset of getting things done quickly, efficiently with the highest quality. His attention to detail stood out and he was always looking at us gaining those small advantages in any way we could due to his analysis. He got on with all his colleagues due to his personality with everyone respecting him. I would highly recommend his skills as a person and a worker!"</p>
                <h4 class="font-weight-bold">Carl Robinson</h4>
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold">Strategic Technical Advisor, Football Association of Wales</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="avatar">
                  <img src="images/Daniel-1.jpg" class="rounded-circle img-fluid" alt="Daniel Parada">
                </div>
                <p>"Hard working, enthusiastic and resourceful are but a few of Navid's characteristics that I witnessed in the time he was my student. In my time as an instructor at the University of Denver, Navid stands out as one of the most remarkable students I've had the pleasure of teaching over three distinct courses. His outside-the-box thinking and persistence makes him exceedingly good at solving large problems one roadblock at a time which allowed him to not only overcome said problems but go beyond what was being asked. In every class he was a very active student, always asking good insightful questions and had an insatiable need to know the underlying mechanics of problems and their solutions. I have no doubt that Navid will be a great addition to any team and I'm confident that given the opportunity everyone will feel as I do."</p>
                <h4 class="font-weight-bold">Daniel Parada</h4>
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold">Adjunct Professor at the University of Denver</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="avatar">
                  <img src="images/Peat.png" class="rounded-circle img-fluid" alt="Andrew Peat">
                </div>
                <p>"Navid is a very dedicated person and demonstrates a high work ethic in his work activities and his passions. He added great value to the department not only in his work but also how displays a positive attitude in all that he does. He works to learn and then quickly applies his learning. He will have strong future in anything and everything his pursues."</p>
                <h4 class="font-weight-bold">Andrew Peat</h4>
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold">Video Analyst, National Teams at Canada Soccer</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="avatar">
                  <img src="images/Koch.jpg" class="rounded-circle img-fluid" alt="Alan Koch">
                </div>
                <p>"I thoroughly enjoyed working with Navid at the Vancouver Whitecaps. He was a true professional, flexible, adaptable to change, and able to deal with the pressure of professional sports in a very calm and articulate manner. The quality of his work was always at an incredibly high standard."</p>
                <h4 class="font-weight-bold">Alan Koch</h4>
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold">Head Coach &amp; Sporting Manager at the University of Guelph</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="testimonial">
                <div class="avatar">
                  <img src="images/Kah.jpg" class="rounded-circle img-fluid" alt="Pa-Modou Kah">
                </div>
                <p>"Navid is a highly motivated person and excellent with the work he does. I had pleasure of working with him for several years at Vancouver Whitecaps FC. A loyal co worker who is dedicated, ambitious and always gets the job done no matter what. He would be an excellent asset to any organization."</p>
                <h4 class="font-weight-bold">Pa-Modou Kah</h4>
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold">Head Coach at Phoenix Rising FC</h6>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

